Runtime Text editor shaped-origin jitter guard validation
Date: 2026-07-03
Status: runtime_text_editor_shaped_origin_jitter_guard_rustfmt_visual_cargo_deferred

Root cause:
- The shaped-position branch accepted matching glyph ids and total width, but did not re-run the local host advance guard.
- A small local shaped-origin borrow could bypass the per-grapheme jitter protection and make tab labels look left/right shifted.

Implementation:
- draw/layout.rs now validates shaped-origin-derived local advances against the selected host face before accepting shaped positions.
- draw/layout/tests.rs keeps small shaped offsets accepted and rejects folder-open.svg style 0.25px local shaped-origin jitter.

